---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hotels Near Arena Burgas | Eurovision 2027 Accommodation" 
  description="Find the best hotels within walking distance of Arena Burgas for the Eurovision Song Contest 2027. Avoid post-show taxi queues and stay in Izgrev or Zornitsa."
  breadcrumb="Hotels Near Arena Burgas"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 class="text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Hotels Near Arena Burgas: The Ultimate Eurovision Convenience</h1>
      
      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        When the Grand Final ends at 1:00 AM, 10,000 fans will pour out of Arena Burgas. The taxi apps will crash, and the queues will be massive. The smartest Eurovision move? Stay within walking distance.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>The "Arena Zone": Izgrev and Zornitsa</h2>
        <p>Arena Burgas is located in the <strong>Izgrev</strong> residential complex, bordered closely by the <strong>Zornitsa</strong> neighborhood. These are primarily local residential areas, meaning you won't find massive mega-resorts here. Instead, the accommodation landscape is dominated by:</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <li>Modern apartment rentals (AirBnb/Booking)</li>
          <li>Boutique 3-star business hotels</li>
          <li>A few highly-rated 4-star properties near the Sea Garden edge</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Walking Distance:</strong> 5 to 20 minutes max.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-magenta);">
        <h3>Why stay near the Arena?</h3>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Zero transit stress:</strong> Walk directly to the stadium. No shuttles, no traffic jams.</li>
          <li><strong>Easy Rehearsal Access:</strong> If you have OGAE tickets or press accreditation for afternoon rehearsals, you can easily go back to your room between shows.</li>
          <li><strong>Local Prices:</strong> Restaurants and supermarkets in Izgrev are priced for locals, not tourists.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>Top Picks Near Arena Burgas</h2>
        <p>Because large hotels are rare right next to the Arena, rooms here will sell out instantly. If you see a listing in <strong>Zornitsa</strong>, <strong>Izgrev</strong>, or <strong>Lazur</strong> (a bit further towards the beach but walkable), book it immediately.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 24px; display: grid; gap: 16px;">
          <a href="/packages" class="btn btn-primary" style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 16px;">Book a Guaranteed Hotel Package</a>
          <a href="/where-to-stay" class="btn btn-secondary" style="text-align: center;">View All Accommodation Zones</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 48px;">Alternative: The City Center</h2>
      <p>If you prioritize nightlife, EuroVillage events, and the beach over arena proximity, the <strong>City Center (Burgas Center)</strong> is a better choice. The city will run dedicated shuttle buses from the central bus station to the Arena on show nights. The ride takes about 15-20 minutes, though you should factor in queue times.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
